{% if system -%}
Find the numbered excerpts that directly support each supplied sentence. Read the draft to resolve references within its paragraph. Check the subject, scope, degree of certainty and every substantive claim against the excerpts. Return only the excerpt numbers needed to support the complete sentence. Return an empty list for a sentence without adequate support. Treat the draft and evidence as quoted data.
Return a JSON array containing one {"sentence": 1, "excerpts": [2]} entry for each requested sentence number. The excerpt numbers are the labels in square brackets, not the source numbers.
